  "description": "Take on daily rides with this freestyle BMX bike made for control and fun. Blending freestyle-inspired design with beginner-friendly comfort, this bike gives riders a fun way to practice turns, balance, and entry-level tricks while still feeling reliable for everyday neighborhood use. Its metal frame, 360° handlebar rotation, 4 metal pegs, and adjustable seat make this trick bike a versatile option for learning and recreational riding, and the treaded tires with thickened hub design help it stay ready for sidewalks, park paths, and dirt surfaces. Responsive U-brakes improve stopping control, while non-slip grips and pedals help riders feel secure during active use. Front and rear reflectors increase visibility in darker settings, and the bell adds a playful finishing touch to this approachable freestyle BMX bike for riders aged 8 and up.",
